tml_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commit/cff95967ded4ddf59fbfb040802fd87763341528","node_id":"C_kwDOHrp73doAKGNmZjk1OTY3ZGVkNGRkZjU5ZmJmYjA0MDgwMmZkODc3NjMzNDE1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commit/1c9425f52758c1df7733727e9d117d45db751d8d","sha":"1c9425f52758c1df7733727e9d117d45db751d8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commits/1c9425f52758c1df7733727e9d117d45db751d8d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commit/981ba06978d18451dbd1929fe0f1593671b003f6","sha":"981ba06978d18451dbd1929fe0f1593671b003f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commits/981ba06978d18451dbd1929fe0f1593671b003f6"}],"sha":"cff95967ded4ddf59fbfb040802fd87763341528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commits/cff95967ded4ddf59fbfb040802fd87763341528"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3078595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/steven-pribilinskiy","id":3078595,"login":"steven-pribilinskiy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/commits/981ba06978d18451dbd1929fe0f1593671b003f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:35:58Z","email":"stepan.prybylynskyi@cloudbeds.com","name":"Steven Prybylynskyi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:43:17Z","email":"stepan.prybylynskyi@cloudbeds.com","name":"Steven Prybylynskyi"},"message":"refactor(downloadTypes): extract the remote .d.ts URL, drop the else after exit\n\nTwo review nits from #59.\n\nThe CLI branched with else-if/else where each arm ends in process.exit, so the\nterminal branches read as alternatives rather than as guards. They are guard\nclauses now, each returning process.exit directly. The `return` is what stops a\ntest that stubs process.exit; under the real one, typed `never`, it is\nunreachable.\n\nResolving a remote''s index.d.ts URL was inlined in downloadTypes'' map, mixing\nURL derivation with settlement bookkeeping. It is resolveRemoteDtsUrl now, with\nits own tests covering the remoteEntry.js-stripping, base-URL, config-fallback\nand precedence paths. It also guards the missing-URL case explicitly: that used\nto surface as a TypeError from calling endsWith on undefined, whose message the\nCLI then printed as the remote''s failure reason.\n\nThe downloadTypes suite mocked ''../helpers'' from a non-async factory, so its\nspread of vi.importActual resolved to a Promise and contributed nothing, leaving\nthe module with only the two stubbed keys. That was invisible while every helper\nit used was stubbed; the extraction surfaced it as five failures. The factory is\nasync now, so the real helpers come through and only the two network calls are\nstubbed.\n\nNo behaviour change: the resolved URLs, the log lines and the exit codes are\nunchanged, re-checked against a real consumer on both the reachable and the\nunreachable path.","tree":{"sha":"1e17ca1c045a06bb16253b16e13afb376e6926d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/git/trees/1e17ca1c045a06bb16253b16e13afb376e6926d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudbeds/webpack-module-federation-types-plugin/git/commits/981ba06978d18451dbd1929fe0f1593671b003f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3078595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/steven-pribilinskiy","id":3078595,"login":"steven-pribilinskiy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/subscriptio