ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikepack","id":247668,"login":"mikepack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzY2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/ddebda7660666397badf7a99e3d3436cfcbdde4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:27:13Z","email":"mikepackdev@gmail.com","name":"Mike Pack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:27:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): re-resolve Sentry/OpenTelemetry within existing @sentry/nextjs ^10.28.0 caret (#455)\n\n@sentry/nextjs''s declared ^10.28.0 range already spans 10.75.3, which no\nlonger bundles the per-driver @opentelemetry/instrumentation-{knex,mongoose,\nmysql,mysql2,pg,tedious} packages as dependencies at all, and drops the\nexact @opentelemetry/core@2.2.0 pin those packages depended on (now 2.11.0).\nRemoved the @sentry/*, @opentelemetry/*, @prisma/instrumentation, and\nimport-in-the-middle lockfile blocks and reran yarn install to let yarn\nre-resolve inside the already-declared range. package.json is unchanged.\n\nClears AIKIDO-2026-222103, -931745, -377409, -612350, -618852, -453378\n(the six instrumentation packages) and CVE-2026-54285 / GHSA-qqmp-wf37-98f9\n(@opentelemetry/core).\n\nVerified cold: yarn lint, yarn test (43 passing), and yarn build (rm -rf\n.next first) all pass, including against the @sentry/bundler-plugin-core\n4.6.1 -> 5.3.0 transitive major pulled in by the newer Sentry release.\n\nAlso corrects the zod register row''s stated floor from 4.4.0 to 4.6.0\n(same blocker holds; zod stays exact-pinned by package.json''s own\n^3.21.4 range).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WzywSCmRu6rWfTBEEcvurM\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7db0c2d054f43a1c9643eb1a8886a07c12f62e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/7db0c2d054f43a1c9643eb1a8886a07c12f62e23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/ddebda7660666397badf7a99e3d3436cfcbdde4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 7db0c2d054f43a1c9643eb1a8886a07c12f62e23\nparent 35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db\nauthor Mike Pack <mikepackdev@gmail.com> 1790281633 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790281633 -0600\n\nfix(deps): re-resolve Sentry/OpenTelemetry within existing @sentry/nextjs ^10.28.0 caret (#455)\n\n@sentry/nextjs''s declared ^10.28.0 range already spans 10.75.3, which no\nlonger bundles the per-driver @opentelemetry/instrumentation-{knex,mongoose,\nmysql,mysql2,pg,tedious} packages as dependencies at all, and drops the\nexact @opentelemetry/core@2.2.0 pin those packages depended on (now 2.11.0).\nRemoved the @sentry/*, @opentelemetry/*, @prisma/instrumentation, and\nimport-in-the-middle lockfile blocks and reran yarn install to let yarn\nre-resolve inside the already-declared range. package.json is unchanged.\n\nClears AIKIDO-2026-222103, -931745, -377409, -612350, -618852, -453378\n(the six instrumentation packages) and CVE-2026-54285 / GHSA-qqmp-wf37-98f9\n(@opentelemetry/core).\n\nVerified cold: yarn lint, yarn test (43 passing), and yarn build (rm -rf\n.next first) all pass, including against the @sentry/bundler-plugin-core\n4.6.1 -> 5.3.0 transitive major pulled in by the newer Sentry release.\n\nAlso corrects the zod register row''s stated floor from 4.4.0 to 4.6.0\n(same blocker holds; zod stays exact-pinned by package.json''s own\n^3.21.4 range).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WzywSCmRu6rWfTBEEcvurM\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtYehCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9EMQABEXiLfGwB1/qPUX4kxBcu+b\nmrt2PFwHgNGxhLHVOXuz4dVVEHNTqjnTUt/9aDnzMH16w9W1T2gYHuPbUNg8fIyi\npnVWx6JuHfi0gJfdX66WbGVpzvx5HWgWaV531nVgr75naexflU0+aA3UJg0WVbwh\nyqw/VzfgCqTGC0Ij5ovuzvWigB4TaETf/AOXC+Dl5nU14bBFv7InEiD7WIdH+fAH\nO0zpJ4M0Jidotv7YEatXu+OKf10rUi8BpFhDoXV40X5s165AQc4Auh4xlhy6FbSd\nm8IcFV71hRjsAOxtFCOZLdD+n3OZoYlmluupyakJczcZbE4kOo/bGphE5b1/zDSw\nvCRQZPUl82iNA0/AAiXeDl0KeL5/yv1c/G4Rc+puIUHLz8m6t3nBYBak2y2o09HE\neifBvf19adjOth1f3+4XfYsAb49sgcrcDyLhwtEkqRPM2UJULTJNLcMQw+X8528O\ngYNQKTS7SoXbFIojAGDlxNuKvKHrSugejFoGAYf1NreqsSTQgWWGzKKPmCPdlvz/\nl74FtKXZ8mGoScUWNSivZSvmZ6j3dEeILKn1F4AF8nnSWNu2ooOOtHP4MoeLLrPI\nAMZqqpj2KSmxo+5jHIRUp3uJYk29Ez/jpqG6timv4TVgKXRqvPT9I6bJgD0rAsdx\naFbAnykKDvS8CabQZqIz\n=dXs6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T20:27:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/awell-health/hosted-pages/commit/ddebda7660666397badf7a99e3d3436cfcbdde4c","node_id":"C_kwDOHttB09oAKGRkZWJkYTc2NjA2NjYzOTdiYWRmN2E5OWUzZDM0MzZjZmNiZGRlNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/awell-health/hosted-pages/commit/35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db","sha":"35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db"}],"sha":"ddebda7660666397badf7a99e3d3436cfcbdde4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/ddebda7660666397badf7a99e3d3436cfcbdde4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247668?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikepack","id":247668,"login":"mikepack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzY2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:49:53Z","email":"mikepackdev@gmail.com","name":"Mike Pack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:49:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(security): register all 15 open advisories as out of range (#454)\n\nRegister-only: a re-resolve pass removed the lockfile entry for all seven\nflagged package groups and reinstalled, and every one came back on the\nsame version. Nothing here is fixable by a lockfile refresh.\n\n  i18next 23.16.8   ^23.16.8 cannot reach the 24.1.2 major (high 84)\n  zod     3.21.4    moved to 3.25.76, top of ^3 -- clears nothing, the\n                    fix floor is 4.4.0\n  immer   10.2.0    already top of range; 11.1.9 is a major\n  @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* and @opentelemetry/core\n                    exact-pinned by @sentry/node@10.28.0, which declares\n                    every instrumentation at an exact version\n  @lexical/link, slate, slate-dom\n                    exact 0.x descriptors; 0.x minors are breaking\n\nAlso records that this is the only yarn 1 (classic) repo in the queue --\nits lockfile uses \"pkg@range:\" rather than berry''s \"pkg@npm:range:\", so\ntooling written for the other repos matches nothing here and reports a\nfalse clean scan.","tree":{"sha":"00baa17163ffef7dfa9fdfbf63f9bcbfe94bb73b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/00baa17163ffef7dfa9fdfbf63f9bcbfe94bb73b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db","verification":{"payload":"tree 00baa17163ffef7dfa9fdfbf63f9bcbfe94bb73b\nparent a303e61cc143b498c89d811e6b55afa0a22b8254\nauthor Mike Pack <mikepackdev@gmail.com> 1790189393 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790189393 -0600\n\ndocs(security): register all 15 open advisories as out of range (#454)\n\nRegister-only: a re-resolve pass removed the lockfile entry for all seven\nflagged package groups and reinstalled, and every one came back on the\nsame version. Nothing here is fixable by a lockfile refresh.\n\n  i18next 23.16.8   ^23.16.8 cannot reach the 24.1.2 major (high 84)\n  zod     3.21.4    moved to 3.25.76, top of ^3 -- clears nothing, the\n                    fix floor is 4.4.0\n  immer   10.2.0    already top of range; 11.1.9 is a major\n  @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* and @opentelemetry/core\n                    exact-pinned by @sentry/node@10.28.0, which declares\n                    every instrumentation at an exact version\n  @lexical/link, slate, slate-dom\n                    exact 0.x descriptors; 0.x minors are breaking\n\nAlso records that this is the only yarn 1 (classic) repo in the queue --\nits lockfile uses \"pkg@range:\" rather than berry''s \"pkg@npm:range:\", so\ntooling written for the other repos matches nothing here and reports a\nfalse clean scan.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtB9RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9DsQAEM15e6CBqUmeY0rHr1H9IEM\nChlLkZjLTexnCI4s0/IV2vOtEUPTy7kxNH8r6D7roYqEJhqIpm0XCxKayvE2xJSu\nT9Arfl6WlqBDtpK5YsBbDpsgSnoWnQD5BWh9yZN+WXAzox+ZFEvGEkYQiZ/YNi/L\nCQ7agfvgXQc2xsiOyA3cF3MMcx+g7GyrX1uKPl9GcqpoFRjabWniUxle4wUHfVNr\n88Ts+P9/ymGkiwpnZuGQ0irbuuOHqRM/00wpOkHK8vZR3HHY9yBTsuH8HYHiyJ2F\nuVj6Suc0BaYOkVx1BV4Nd6lInZwSW7vrUDL5R3tn9FeohbDoxQR0Cf7CziECia0K\nMeZ+UFvwjgt6zpSIUWyOAkQphlBZYIrg6SkTJSeYojDqfojtKLkVuwmhN3h9TLzZ\nkuyXqjqGLqqPzgkbt9628kWrhpaFXh57Q3G8+zD77TSPQi9wbsLAhBJBsyEIxP9J\nVR6RSdP+AN5DX76nNro3ljQRsNYk0ZFMuvX+Y4qzsFU5jzCVB2xfU/DxEqSlUWZj\nI4Uq0Pxf3PeJowr0hXPb5iGjDRTskJlTctUs8RTXkibdcoyyDKZKh24ZsE1bgDH6\n9p9E0/g/KqjOlfxHn5E+e8lVp7lUgTmpxZ0vT0KagQtMqaZym6sQe27lRYI0xvew\nhYNepgAO9qHtLbhkBm1S\n=HQf9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T18:49:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/awell-health/hosted-pages/commit/35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db","node_id":"C_kwDOHttB09oAKDM1NjEyYTE3MDhiMzkxOTE1NDIzMzE1ODk1Y2JhNTllZWMzYWY5ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/awell-health/hosted-pages/commit/a303e61cc143b498c89d811e6b55afa0a22b8254","sha":"a303e61cc143b498c89d811e6b55afa0a22b8254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/a303e61cc143b498c89d811e6b55afa0a22b8254"}],"sha":"35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/35612a1708b391915423315895cba59eec3af9db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247668?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikepack","id":247668,"login":"mikepack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzY2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikepack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/a303e61cc143b498c89d811e6b55afa0a22b8254/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:55:14Z","email":"mikepackdev@gmail.com","name":"Mike Pack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:55:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): re-resolve the medium-band carets — dompurify, @babel/traverse, @grpc/grpc-js, qs, picomatch, react-hook-form (#453)\n\nEvery one of these was a declared caret that already spanned the fix and had\nnever been re-resolved; classic yarn does not re-resolve a transitive on\n`yarn upgrade`, so the lock blocks were removed and `yarn install` re-created\nthem in range. No manifest change.\n\n  dompurify        2.4.7  -> 2.5.9   (CVE-2024-47875, 62; via @awell-health/ui-library ^2.4.0)\n  @babel/traverse  7.20.12 -> 7.28.5/7.29.8 (AIKIDO-2025-10745, 60; build tooling)\n  @grpc/grpc-js    1.10.8 -> 1.10.12 (CVE-2024-37168, 53; ~1.10.3 via google-gax)\n  qs               6.15.3 -> 6.16.0  (AIKIDO-2026-81971, CVE-2026-82417, 53)\n  picomatch        2.3.1/4.0.3 -> 2.3.2/4.0.7 (CVE-2026-33672, 53)\n  react-hook-form  7.52.1/7.72.1 -> 7.87.0 (AIKIDO-2024-10523, 47; one copy now)\n\ntsc --noEmit clean; vitest 43/43. Register rows added for the mediums a\nre-resolve cannot reach: the OpenTelemetry instrumentations and core pinned by\n@sentry/node, @lexical/link pinned by ui-library/mdxeditor, immer 10 -> 11 and\nzod 3 -> 4 (majors).\n\nPart of AWL-4333.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bacc75b614861bd53608886fd827a044ad96343b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/bacc75b614861bd53608886fd827a044ad96343b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/a303e61cc143b498c89d811e6b55afa0a22b8254","verification":{"payload":"tree bacc75b614861bd53608886fd827a044ad96343b\nparent 3da3b3f634abe9f9c964af52881ccf8819b1a643\nauthor Mike Pack <mikepackdev@gmail.com> 1788904514 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788904514 -0600\n\nfix(deps): re-resolve the medium-band carets — dompurify, @babel/traverse, @grpc/grpc-js, qs, picomatch, react-hook-form (#453)\n\nEvery one of these was a declared caret that already spanned the fix and had\nnever been re-resolved; classic yarn does not re-resolve a transitive on\n`yarn upgrade`, so the lock blocks were removed and `yarn install` re-created\nthem in range. No manifest change.\n\n  dompurify        2.4.7  -> 2.5.9   (CVE-2024-47875, 62; via @awell-health/ui-library ^2.4.0)\n  @babel/traverse  7.20.12 -> 7.28.5/7.29.8 (AIKIDO-2025-10745, 60; build tooling)\n  @grpc/grpc-js    1.10.8 -> 1.10.12 (CVE-2024-37168, 53; ~1.10.3 via google-gax)\n  qs               6.15.3 -> 6.16.0  (AIKIDO-2026-81971, CVE-2026-82417, 53)\n  picomatch        2.3.1/4.0.3 -> 2.3.2/4.0.7 (CVE-2026-33672, 53)\n  react-hook-form  7.52.1/7.72.1 -> 7.87.0 (AIKIDO-2024-10523, 47; one copy now)\n\ntsc --noEmit clean; vitest 43/43. Register rows added for the mediums a\nre-resolve cannot reach: the OpenTelemetry instrumentations and core pinned by\n@sentry/node, @lexical/link pinned by ui-library/mdxeditor, immer 10 -> 11 and\nzod 3 -> 4 (majors).\n\nPart of AWL-4333.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoIRCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0y0QABEt75eQMvnaW3puXm2pYihq\n3KY44vmAi3uEnIoby4pGJnNp/TTB+Wz+lydZO3g4C5JdtvGOgIarNW9G4pqoY+9c\nw8nTQCf7D9YasUW3tIFYbX5Dzyg7a6o0cQf/DCGk9YbbHDO9lA+G77uJsERKZyCv\npDLQRP29irXaD5yjdt4zpXgayxgmifDIj6SJLikcO0dnqAIpHF7EnJg80ciE1BLk\namG7T1fAa1HYeIyaGpMovZng0/RPhRVE+H3eVbqsQLRgjdhBmGsu4lh1G1hvxvoK\nL8v1Ncpv573CgWfFsrZl7c6f9JUylVvFlpSfDYOVe+XbVabE0gUg8ymAfwyJKG4s\ntjaTLy7viLsJJer9U8lWDX45VDiIZg25MD8JoqaAUDblz8echhVj116kQVkCyDRq\n5t++zRQJKIxl2WNBCyK1EgKqx3l6dSOa/Znw7qIYRIoYQocQ9HHagjLcEKGu2AKj\nPoovNZSREickxVxNTRew/wsnyw95zLsbHXLpaWXe2DOxf97jdBwj76Qx8PAARC/v\nghKCRPhy1vp