ider lifecycle events: CONNECTIVITY_VISIBILITY_CHANGED, CONNECTIVITY_STATE_CHANGED, CONNECTIVITY_PROVIDER_MOUNTED, and CONNECTIVITY_PROVIDER_UNMOUNTED.\n- Refactored polling task registration to utilize refs for improved performance and prevent unnecessary re-renders.","tree":{"sha":"3f1464a6d276aa3be8f288da5eff7391e2d01e3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/3f1464a6d276aa3be8f288da5eff7391e2d01e3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/5bf81eeef559c7ab32b507539558a00f7af9e20d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f1464a6d276aa3be8f288da5eff7391e2d01e3e\nparent 2c1083684758b79d6c1210f5532ca0194b68c4c1\nauthor ebomcke-awell <47522087+ebomcke-awell@users.noreply.github.com> 1778588174 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778588174 +0200\n\nFix hosted-session polling stopping mid-session and add observability (#421)\n\n- Added new log events for session polling lifecycle: SESSION_START_POLLING, SESSION_STOP_POLLING, SESSION_POLLING_TASK_REGISTERED, SESSION_POLLING_TASK_UNREGISTERED, SESSION_POLLING_EFFECT_RAN, and SESSION_POLLING_EFFECT_CLEANUP.\n- Implemented logging for connectivity state changes and provider lifecycle events: CONNECTIVITY_VISIBILITY_CHANGED, CONNECTIVITY_STATE_CHANGED, CONNECTIVITY_PROVIDER_MOUNTED, and CONNECTIVITY_PROVIDER_UNMOUNTED.\n- Refactored polling task registration to utilize refs for improved performance and prevent unnecessary re-renders.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAxoOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnpwQAHxMIKH3XSnwwbehoQzh8WCk\nXugpt5tE39A7TefciQJs7R09rE76CWPd6igCMhiDBsyve4v/oag7sAbL3mkhtiUm\nih8C3S8ucDxgR+zMXdxsFTcp8L/Yl+QUGbsIxIyYvnvb7B6lWISBQRcpI5nzrev1\nsJeqZQ1jAjslGvfe7hBBxCCM6ovLC0vs3+ox1oD/nk6wJ5MI1HPmNyLMWh7Xoc9V\nwnvin8BYlkJJx/pX/wyDHilRxfCo1XvS1cd4Se8PJjNx2qKQV14p5J7CPD+ehLew\nK7+GrYQwbwYTKIv6fn1zyQ27Lo8Lvv73s6wewOXfg6nRVhKz2QFYYduXEvkBjvh2\nasqCvDeD0LBrpYkBmQMszN2UG/sKSC/rGS5xGFwMI4u3BniSw3BVAqvGwag9uJ9e\nob0d