ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejoinka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejoinka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejoinka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/3a93823b322d7263eccb16abdc8e1c41c909377c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-31T17:57:52Z","email":"jonathan@awellhealth.com","name":"JB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-31T17:57:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add tracking/UTM parameter support for hosted session mutations (#400)\n\nAdd support for capturing UTM parameters and custom query parameters\nfrom URLs and passing them to hosted session start mutations.\n\n- Create extractTrackingParams utility to extract UTM params (utm_source,\n  utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_term, utm_content) and custom params\n  from URL query strings\n- Update startHostedPathwaySession to accept and pass tracking to\n  startHostedPathwaySessionFromLink mutation\n- Update startHostedActivitySession to accept and pass tracking to\n  startHostedActivitySessionViaHostedPagesLink mutation\n- Update page components (c/[hostedPagesLinkId] and l/[hostedPagesLinkId])\n  to extract tracking params from query and pass to session start functions\n- Update StartHostedActivitySessionParams type to include optional tracking\n\nCustom parameters (non-UTM, non-system params) are automatically included\nin the tracking.custom field. System parameters (hostedPagesLinkId,\npatient_identifier, track_id, activity_id, sessionId, locale) are\nexcluded from tracking.\n\nRelated ticket: AWL-3714","tree":{"sha":"519cdd8a2f408a4985bd1f3223a82f0ab93277ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/519cdd8a2f408a4985bd1f3223a82f0ab93277ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/3a93823b322d7263eccb16abdc8e1c41c909377c","verification":{"payload":"tree 519cdd8a2f408a4985bd1f3223a82f0ab93277ec\nparent c0a45fb7ddf8a50772ccf27927f9981f164a18cb\nauthor JB <jonathan@awellhealth.com> 1767203872 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767203872 -0500\n\nfeat: add tracking/UTM parameter support for hosted session mutations (#400)\n\nAdd support for capturing UTM parameters and custom query parameters\nfrom URLs and passing them to hosted session start mutations.\n\n- Create extractTrackingParams utility to extract UTM params (utm_source,\n  utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_term, utm_content) and custom params\n  from URL query strings\n- Update startHostedPathwaySession to accept and pass tracking to\n  startHostedPathwaySessionFromLink mutation\n- Update startHostedActivitySession to accept and pass tracking to\n  startHostedActivitySessionViaHostedPagesLink mutation\n- Update page components (c/[hostedPagesLinkId] and l/[hostedPagesLinkId])\n  to extract tracking params from query and pass to session start functions\n- Update StartHostedActivitySessionParams type to include optional tracking\n\nCustom parameters (non-UTM, non-system params) are automatically included\nin the tracking.custom field. System parameters (hostedPagesLinkId,\npatient_identifier, track_id, activity_id, sessionId, locale) are\nexcluded from tracking.\n\nRelated ticket: AWL-3714","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVWQgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdaYQAFFhPl8kViNWuXi21lNeQnP3\nGHqznJAyb7gGWEI+BEgL5tHsdc6HyaImdCqGjw7fLpC0FDNjLpXohkhpwH7rC+aI\nH//MVEadYHG46kMZ79tTAF7vFmw3NSZ0svNSOKvjSjgsz0O0c5qDp4E0SXNr0XdO\nyLdHRVN4ZOmfZUPfQUpqUiP+kbY1q8wtS/VflpLfI/vkKpD6QOaN3rDJ0Ah9Gk+5\nfhMzXDm/NC5LdHeNF2GdXbiTlzuHPUw9HKP2eAERUUPbroGPfhr0XOTXnOdkpjuI\nrzNjsybxv3WKf3Peg3Qpt8mRSRdl4Ivm/+HSAVaKGTxlV3mM0HgfyYjgviOx69Vl\nhZ6HIHfu5zTS/iM8il4Iwe3ea9a8WBsTT5FeFsKja/6J/C6P8Q3LCfQmytLRRDfF\nbQuUhrb+Lg6OZUQrmp9PCCUBHF1E3ZkWY9cfBEJQ4zP3T2IbKQem40m5SvbokvJ/\nQdYp9Z5SdYhkG5U+qzT+ppUdTeCY8nMzO6g40EO2+ejlLnu4MpNQvLxj7hh6RLmO\nb