//api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ebomcke-awell","id":47522087,"login":"ebomcke-awell","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTIyMDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebomcke-awell","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/c0a45fb7ddf8a50772ccf27927f9981f164a18cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-30T15:43:53Z","email":"47522087+ebomcke-awell@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ebomcke-awell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-30T15:43:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Debounce evaluateFormRules mutation for traditional forms (#397)\n\n* Debounce evaluateFormRules mutation for traditional forms\n\nDebounce the evaluateFormRules mutation call in traditional forms\nto avoid calling it on every keystroke. The debounced function has\na 300ms delay with trailing option and handles undefined returns by\nresolving with an empty array.\n\n* fix(Form): add missing dependencies to useCallback/useMemo hooks\n\n- Add session?.id and session?.organization_slug to handleEvaluateFormRules\n- Add session?.id and session?.organization_slug to handleSubmit\n- Add activity.id and getGcsSignedUrl to handleFileUpload\n- Add t to error_labels useMemo\n- Remove unused imports (useRef, logger, LogEvent)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: JB <jonathan@awellhealth.com>","tree":{"sha":"c18e07357e431a2e5ba8c368aa02bbce837e5c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/c18e07357e431a2e5ba8c368aa02bbce837e5c12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/c0a45fb7ddf8a50772ccf27927f9981f164a18cb","verification":{"payload":"tree c18e07357e431a2e5ba8c368aa02bbce837e5c12\nparent 88bab0c09ab1766b67b38ad2c1b12c7759e51ec4\nauthor ebomcke-awell <47522087+ebomcke-awell@users.noreply.github.com> 1767109433 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767109433 -0500\n\nDebounce evaluateFormRules mutation for traditional forms (#397)\n\n* Debounce evaluateFormRules mutation for traditional forms\n\nDebounce the evaluateFormRules mutation call in traditional forms\nto avoid calling it on every keystroke. The debounced function has\na 300ms delay with trailing option and handles undefined returns by\nresolving with an empty array.\n\n* fix(Form): add missing dependencies to useCallback/useMemo hooks\n\n- Add session?.id and session?.organization_slug to handleEvaluateFormRules\n- Add session?.id and session?.organization_slug to handleSubmit\n- Add activity.id and getGcsSignedUrl to handleFileUpload\n- Add t to error_labels useMemo\n- Remove unused imports (useRef, logger, LogEvent)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: JB <jonathan@awellhealth.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpU/M5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzckQAFatyMoC8mda/eNU07G/NrHj\nqAux8MqZKASZMdXnzb9d27K9a3LBJgNsaJFTSNe11R8V9Zz6uwEpTZYwqrurMe+O\ne/V/rDs3G1K8IeYtURA/F+I277RKP67JSScx01g8LV1+dQ2Lb04j1n0+52u790vE\nmXLCCstFC0Tr79UbLO77Lo2XpHzWekezVaBUMG6uSiB16Z13mhWuai/iuYPqcP50\nafwWlsM+JOVW/GJrSzA83ZUFJ1ny+nDVS4PLt2n/XLCzPsz69y8gvIKakywIdQkr\nnkLgQpOO/v4SRAU7SNVZsAto56ZsGA8m+PbLpwMAhx6/UeaGX+CsfHlyeNvksXr0\n2wWsWMlBq40hZ16sMl/iP6LHS5otC7tDhecZPff2Qss5XEY47p5OCrR5noyI8O43\nW1RI1vLxslSIKyf75IhESNtjmPGvFUJprz3/y5Y2SCq85OjeJicQSwPC5b4fO23f\n4H5dNVn3LokdH4XUmwTGuPf5bEhQF+nYpEwBqOFvv3L9n/bep+cYuGAczm1KJM8b\nAq