D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/commits/de7b37dc3b370e50eb38b6dc37627079eebeb659/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-04T16:48:13Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"devin-ai-integration[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-04T16:48:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add salesforceLeadId and magicLink to booking API response (#373)\n\n* Add salesforceLeadId and magicLink to booking API response\n\n- Add salesforceLeadId to ActionFields type\n- Extract salesforceLeadId from action fields in IntakeScheduling component\n- Pass salesforceLeadId in booking request userInfo\n- Enhance booking API response to include both salesforceLeadId and magicLink\n- Supports REV-478 requirement for SOL to track bookings with unique identifiers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Nick Hellemans <NickHellemans93@gmail.com>\n\n* Remove magicLink generation from booking API response\n\n- Remove magicLink generation logic using NEXT_PUBLIC_DOMAIN\n- Remove magicLink from enhanced response object\n- Keep salesforceLeadId functionality intact\n- Booking API now only returns salesforceLeadId in response data\n\nCo-Authored-By: abi@awellhealth.com <abi@awellhealth.com>\n\n* bump yarn scheduling\n\n* remove changes that are not needed\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nick Hellemans <NickHellemans93@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: abi@awellhealth.com <abi@awellhealth.com>\nCo-authored-by: Abigaila Ekiert <arekiert@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb64f7e571a5feebb4943ea4ab3eb10957eb3a68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/trees/fb64f7e571a5feebb4943ea4ab3eb10957eb3a68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/hosted-pages/git/commits/de7b37dc3b370e50eb38b6dc37627079eebeb659","verification":{"payload":"tree fb64f7e571a5feebb4943ea4ab3eb10957eb3a68\nparent 16b4a4d3964fca535401083c46b94f0abfc6b475\nauthor devin-ai-integration[bot] <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1757004493 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1757004493 +0200\n\nAdd salesforceLeadId and magicLink to booking API response (#373)\n\n* Add salesforceLeadId and magicLink to booking API response\n\n- Add salesforceLeadId to ActionFields type\n- Extract salesforceLeadId from action fields in IntakeScheduling component\n- Pass salesforceLeadId in booking request userInfo\n- Enhance booking API response to include both salesforceLeadId and magicLink\n- Supports REV-478 requirement for SOL to track bookings with unique identifiers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Nick Hellemans <NickHellemans93@gmail.com>\n\n* Remove magicLink generation from booking API response\n\n- Remove magicLink generation logic using NEXT_PUBLIC_DOMAIN\n- Remove magicLink from enhanced response object\n- Keep salesforceLeadId functionality intact\n- Booking API now only returns salesforceLeadId in response data\n\nCo-Authored-By: abi@awellhealth.com <abi@awellhealth.com>\n\n* bump yarn scheduling\n\n* remove changes that are not needed\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nick Hellemans <NickHellemans93@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: abi@awellhealth.com <abi@awellhealth.com>\nCo-authored-by: Abigaila Ekiert <arekiert@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoucLNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4VUQAG7W6aQJPI+h51hxV8RpTWN/\nUL0KDQmtgjbQo7SSebGmpDbtqDVjfFnXfdxGyTBI4WeunOxjmxvEiOwVpta7BB8l\n1pPGbZWl6/VTrEbimhif9nqNrRy1U7rRuh9TWTQ1Og+nDnHbD+/CCQlVOWarkDgf\nDLH/IoCvQ4LMzKKkh+/QKjC0Oe9MgIfTMPAKr+KXYRBH4hgZtwrkas2mraof2J2K\n3OBqMPknIcmIaEmdBrc+BaBEHtWX3qIvVf48RYtvelr6ZEA2XISpjDeB9LJ29k0O\n/ZJnmSnmSp7Je4nDlxtuwlob5XY4lkgBDTN7pdyGO+CGwARNqrJcxMyu8X/jswqp\nUHNXWVDDHKwVHg5AYgGwJKz2/cYeFQqCzDKUc+ZP/llS1EUWvfWQOLHdHeQmg1do\n4dev7wYRsAqqkpPSP