s.md). llms.txt also\n  points AI tools at /openapi.yaml, since the API reference renders client-side.\n- A \"Copy page\" split button next to the breadcrumbs on every doc page:\n  Copy page (Markdown), View as Markdown, Open in ChatGPT, Open in Claude.\n  Menu clicks send a gtag \"page_action\" event so usage can be measured.\n\nRefs: TEM-45266, BAT-5724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove broken Docs GPT link from navbar\n\nThe navbar \"Docs GPT\" link points to a custom ChatGPT GPT published from a\npersonal account. It returns \"We are sorry, but you do not have access to GPT\ninteractions\" (reproduced logged out), the company can''t maintain or update\nit, and its knowledge is likely stale. Remove it until a supported in-site\nreplacement is chosen.\n\nRefs: TEM-45266, BAT-5724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: meccaand <198965399+meccaand@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"895fad48f3c2d128ab955b08ecc25166aae5714b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ganymede-Bio/website-docusaurus/git/trees/895fad48f3c2d128ab955b08ecc25166aae5714b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ganymede-Bio/website-docusaurus/git/commits/de37b3eededea98ef691f1afca13eee7419ba799","verification":{"payload":"tree 895fad48f3c2d128ab955b08ecc25166aae5714b\nparent b2b4479b5fe02bb79ee0f3b2a84dcbc985eb8b26\nauthor meccaand <andrew@ganymede.bio> 1791219655 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791219655 -0400\n\nAdd llms.txt and a \"Copy page\" AI menu to doc pages (#648)\n\n* Add llms.txt and a \"Copy page\" AI menu to doc pages\n\nReplaces the broken Docs GPT navbar link with AI access that needs no\nGanymede-owned ChatGPT account:\n\n- docusaurus-plugin-llms generates /llms.txt, /llms-full.txt, and a Markdown\n  copy of every doc page (<route>.md; the root doc is /docs.md). llms.txt also\n  points AI tools at /openapi.yaml, since the API reference renders client-side.\n- A \"Copy page\" split button next to the breadcrumbs on every doc page:\n  Copy page (Markdown), View as Markdown, Open in ChatGPT, Open in Claude.\n  Menu clicks send a gtag \"page_action\" event so usage can be measured.\n\nRefs: TEM-45266, BAT-5724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove broken Docs GPT link from navbar\n\nThe navbar \"Docs GPT\" link points to a custom ChatGPT GPT published from a\npersonal account. It returns \"We are sorry, but you do not have access to GPT\ninteractions\" (reproduced logged out), the company can''t maintain or update\nit, and its knowledge is likely stale. Remove it until a supported in-site\nreplacement is chosen.\n\nRefs: TEM-45266, BAT-5724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: meccaand <198965399+meccaand@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9fHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5fkQAKsvGPrkpWMX5zX3mC0FcxNC\nRwqxVqpUKLWoVHysSEjLbFw9iZ2qImzOjQYrp+5xuuQd/KLOIv3vkyoccNdvGYru\n0pZR+lfRjK0O08HtOMcwkY/3dJIiTuyr6M/+MeHsunjy4kXupqiulSnXLoGODx+d\n9M8EvW/g4XaCWxkvDmFwsLR7quANAczX3K44IzQEUM/HeoccF9MIfYZ5r4nAQ10Z\n2UoJxWRriHhAG+jcni2w0bTHLu9wWoYDekyUQWjf/+g7Iii2HxkXd0C4/Exej+Jc\nXBG0l5XfryHAHALs8a+F515t0o0CCyN4PgkveD+6K6sp2OdC+mgD7LVoUL2XNwkL\nGFLIplkyJm/NcKYx7MYf9v8Adxg3Gdx9fpHwGopTmYtprLFNpH4wiLDGnq552TJN\n55wGHeI/EYNlUVldBm6Idwx63f2NKrvNmEGbtjtCRtr5HawyIrzAqyBsAocgTK7b\nlDLaTFOEloJER0lOJon8f2DJ8FvyKjSpt0t6cNJfMCj8FNw+ci5jHNQhAzA6Ec3I\n6KBbaORc4kqRrR3JmLvKXbKx0EQWl9Ti7DLLtuu6GLyr/ELnQK3H8Y9KL9OSF4TM\nuI3/atsaXub6N2pCXhFi4HxYpwP3Be13qUG/6mpkE6xEZ5DbI7806VI2Cpqqx83C\nRgVnqCfUwD8SgfVuA9Av\n=PfNK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:00:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we