ate":"2026-09-11T21:38:04Z","email":"125295923+eriis1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Erik Riis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T21:38:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update API spec with new public endpoints (#638)\n\n* Update API spec with new public endpoints\n\nRegenerated static/openapi.yaml and Postman collection from the latest\napi-server submodule via scripts/update-api-spec.sh.\n\nAdds 42 new public API endpoints, including the Tempo module (batch\nruns/templates, procedure runs/templates/steps, materials, equipment,\nsamples, exceptions, etc.), dashboards, custom-images, connection-health,\nexport-credentials, audit, notifications, and modularAnalysis versions/diff.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove unreleased Tempo endpoints from API spec\n\nStrip the Tempo endpoints and their Tempo-only schemas from the public\nAPI spec and Postman collection. These exist in api-server main but have\nnot been publicly released yet. Done directly on the generated artifacts\n(not via prepare-api-spec.js filtering) so a fresh regen from the\nsubmodule restores them automatically once Tempo ships.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Erik Riis <eriis1024@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b575ac4308a1343f495e0ae9e7bbe7d9a8363567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ganymede-Bio/website-docusaurus/git/trees/b575ac4308a1343f495e0ae9e7bbe7d9a8363567"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ganymede-Bio/website-docusaurus/git/commits/dfe4bde066858018a299c039ca47b1cb8922e288","verification":{"payload":"tree b575ac4308a1343f495e0ae9e7bbe7d9a8363567\nparent 538c7f8d109e0fded41b0757a74b908284fe4867\nauthor Erik Riis <125295923+eriis1@users.noreply.github.com> 1789162684 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789162684 -0700\n\nUpdate API spec with new 