oker.State)\n- setTimeStart(number | null), setTimeInterval(string)\n- loadObject(oid: string, iconExists: boolean), getHistory(id: string)\n- typed the interval lookup objects (Record<string, {count,format}> / string)\n\n`any` is kept only where the value is genuinely dynamic (echarts callback\nparams, dynamic widget config data). Type-only change; widgets/ unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e002e5d8877ae5dde3497eb69c2472e941b1094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-energy/git/trees/9e002e5d8877ae5dde3497eb69c2472e941b1094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-energy/git/commits/7cc7857a3ec3cf9b8dbac22a409329f0be4e4bbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63002482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hombach","id":63002482,"login":"hombach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hombach","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-energy/commit/7cc7857a3ec3cf9b8dbac22a409329f0be4e4bbf","node_id":"C_kwDOHxax79oAKDdjYzc4NTdhM2VjM2NmOWI4ZGJhYzIyYTQwOTMyOWYwYmU0ZTRiYmY"