ports misalignment.\n\nExits 0 when all packages use the same TS version; exits non-zero\nwith details showing exact version per package when mismatched.\n\nIntegrates into scripts/check.sh as new ts-version-aligner command\nand runs as part of static-checks gate.\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c84914e1786e18866c736f3ca6cc89f30c1c6a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/c84914e1786e18866c736f3ca6cc89f30c1c6a5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/7a7118c6fb233f6be2ed36b31259580925835c56","verification":{"payload":"tree c84914e1786e18866c736f3ca6cc89f30c1c6a5a\nparent d71188c0795085504adfcd6b17d2582bee628437\nauthor cheshireCode <1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com> 1788809129 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788809129 -0400\n\nts-version-aligner: add single-pass TS version scanner across workspace packages (#77)\n\nAdd scripts/check-ts-version.mjs that reads pnpm-workspace.yaml,\ndiscovers all 23 packages, parses devDependencies.typescript from\neach package.json, and reports misalignment.\n\nExits 0 when all packages use the same TS version; exits non-zero\nwith details showing exact version per package when mismatched.\n\nIntegrates into scripts/check.sh as new ts-version-aligner command\nand runs as part of static-checks gate.\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnw+pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQswQAExpB/FhrwXN0ZZOtnxNp9vx\nLhKVqky17YRDyekUiV7/oE4fAbbLFQGFfK5bkbOqM8Kw1oN34YQ90nZWYLmsLJG6\ngE6GritpgKJvRwfUAgKzes4gw+mMNnbihh+znRD1ievpasAecxetU0F2IwYzSkFN\nSvmWhuareGrx1pfYTX3pw7zuirQmw0J6pol9p/nIfPvbW3UigzDm2wtwlFaBGGPa\nPpkovmjdx6Vdsh+m4sNzSjjpyj08HC3u/rHaik6xJ9nEaK5w+/SjDm63RbHVWgAg\nkafgCqY4pxXDzdcYnCRIOdaL3D8sbAReNNMeuio0qhZO5TqDGOOsDOs36NOV4ZIE\n4Q8I982gJFSiA6z69OBtKeGTPp