tils, object-utils, error-utils, eslint-config-base\n\nCouncil-validated additions:\n\n- @cheshirecode/vitest-config: extract root vitest.shared.mjs into a\n  publishable config package (packageTestConfig, domPackageTestConfig,\n  rootSmokeTestConfig, viteAppTestConfig)\n\n- @cheshirecode/async-utils: timeout, delay, retry (exponential backoff),\n  debounce, throttle — pure functions, zero dependencies\n\n- @cheshirecode/object-utils: deepClone, deepMerge (immutable),\n  deepEqual, pick, omit — pure functions, zero dependencies\n\n- @cheshirecode/error-utils: AppError, NetworkError, AuthError,\n  ValidationError, NotFoundError + createErrorBoundary, withErrorLogging,\n  tryOrDefault helpers\n\n- @cheshirecode/eslint-config-base: non-React ESLint flat config to pair\n  with eslint-config-react\n\nAlso updates: README.md workspace map, scripts/package-drift.mjs\n(version allowlist), scripts/dogfood.mjs (dogfood assertions),\nscripts/readme-map.json (package classifications).","tree":{"sha":"39ef084e5c75c85610cc3d8c7b5f7d31725328c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/39ef084e5c75c85610cc3d8c7b5f7d31725328c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/78d2949e05b8ff85f95cd08185a1401e6c65939d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1631630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheshirecode","id":1631630,"login":"cheshirecode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzE2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/orgs","r