ish, back-links, and cleanup\n\nNav strip:\n- Pill links to each framework standalone app\n- Per-framework accent color on hover and focus-visible\n\nPreview polish:\n- Staggered card entrance animation (60ms offsets, fade+slide)\n- Scale/clamp headings inside card mounts (clamp(15px, 2vw, 20px))\n- Vertical centering of microfrontend content in preview area\n- Reduced-motion support disables both animation and transition\n\nCross-framework back-navigation:\n- Back-to-showcase links on all 6 renderer apps (React/Preact/Vue/Svelte/SolidJS/Astro)\n- Proper page titles on all standalone apps and the showcase index\n- React SSR title updated from generic ''app-react'' to ''React renderer''\n- React AppTree uses demo-contract title instead of scoped package name\n- Subtle underline reveal on back-link hover (scaleX animation)\n- Back-links auto-hidden inside showcase card mounts\n\nNetlify & infrastructure:\n- Deploy-preview and branch-deploy context sections in netlify.toml\n- Removed stale packages/brief-schema directory (no package.json, git-untracked)\n- Updated README workspace map\n- Fixed verify-renderer-showcase.mjs variable name bug (expectedRendererAppIds -> expectedIds)\n- Updated dist snippet check to match new page title\n\nCloses: showcase-nav-strip, showcase-preview-polish, netlify-deploy-previews,\n        brief-schema-cleanup, showcase-back-link-hover, netlify-badge-confirm","tree":{"sha":"ecee91b763aa752e550c4a6452ede0e6765e8713","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/ecee91b763aa752e550c4a6452ede0e6765e8713"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/85f28dcaee0b93f911c689729deea0719385894d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1631630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/events{/privacy}","follo