hirecode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzE2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/commits/7d2e455acfed521f57efde073bb86a3957c4d715/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T02:59:32Z","email":"1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheshireCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T02:59:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: activate Netlify deploy-status badge + programmatic updater (#44)\n\nPoint the README badge at the live site (badge image needs the API id / UUID; the\nlink uses the site name). Add scripts/update-netlify-badge.mjs to rewrite the badge\nid/name from --site-id/--site-name flags, NETLIFY_SITE_ID/SITE_ID env, or\n.netlify/state.json, so a rename or re-created site is a one-command update rather than\na hand edit. Verified: idempotent when current, updates + reverts correctly, badge URL\nreturns a valid SVG, readme-map passes.\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccb0fe94eeda263739a0c68b46ee901ff128ebeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/ccb0fe94eeda263739a0c68b46ee901ff128ebeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/7d2e455acfed521f57efde073bb86a3957c4d715","verification":{"payload":"tree ccb0fe94eeda263739a0c68b46ee901ff128ebeb\nparent 8d7e6a2b262c2009158be9b5f863f5a551cac691\nauthor cheshireCode <1631