,"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/commits/8d7e6a2b262c2009158be9b5f863f5a551cac691/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:46:15Z","email":"1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheshireCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:46:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(showcase): clickable metadata cards for each renderer app (#43)\n\nReplace the plain host tiles with a polished card layout. Each card links to the\napp''s standalone /apps/<name>/ page (stretched-link pattern so the whole card is\nclickable without wrapping the live demo in an anchor) and surfaces metadata:\nframework, version (read from the showcase''s own deps), and render mode\n(SSR / SPA / static). A masthead shows Netlify build info (commit, context, time)\ninjected via Vite define.\n\nThe shared @cheshirecode/microfrontend-host stays untouched; a showcase-local shell\nrenders the cards and provides the same mount points, so mountMicrofrontends still\nhydrates each live preview (kept non-interactive; interaction happens on the standalone\npage). Design applies OKLCH tinted neutrals, per-framework accent keyline, light/dark\ntheme, and hover motion.\n\nVerified: typecheck + tests pass (incl. new shell tests), dist verification passes,\nbrowser render confirmed (cards, versions, modes, live previews; whole card clickable).\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a98fc6f1afc12a9370e8bae9e1731f9ebc2b5c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/6a98fc6f1afc12a9370e8bae9e1731f9ebc2b5c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/8d7e6a2b262c2009158be9b5f863f5a551cac691","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a98fc6f1afc12a9370e8bae9e1731f9ebc2b5c1\nparent 2f625a8e80ff39bfac9d83a9f0167b8f5eccc470\nauthor cheshireCode <1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com> 1784580375 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784580375 -0700\n\nfeat(showcase): clickable metadata cards for each renderer app (#43)\n\nReplace the plain host tiles with a polished card layout. Each card links to the\napp''s standalone /apps/<name>/ page (stretched-link pattern so the whole card is\nclickable without wrapping the live demo in an anchor) and surfaces metadata:\nframework, version (read from the showcase''s own deps), and render mode\n(SSR / SPA / static). A masthead shows Netlify build info (commit, context, time)\ninjected via Vite define.\n\nThe shared @cheshirecode/microfrontend-host stays untouched; a showcase-local shell\nrenders the cards and provides the same mount points, so mountMicrofrontends still\nhydrates each live preview (kept non-interactive; interaction happens on the standalone\npage). Design applies OKLCH tinted neutrals, per-framework accent keyline, light/dark\ntheme, and hover motion.\n\nVerified: typecheck + tests pass (incl. new shell tests), dist verification passes,\nbrowser render confirmed (cards, versions, modes, live previews; whole card clickable).\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXokXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp5UQAGzMIR5jxQeyzaC+2/0wwo4h\nsDXu0n2mWl/HklCyqII7WgP25mpXWRPLaxNNP69jnC+r0z/aFpdCI/stbvGAPW4z\nQeP8lrTS0o0pmc0TFkfSIs6HnEJDVuNzTop4c0txfoTsMUOB1XO9URQ0scIIZyRU\nslv8WrX//TJmQAu2LIUXAto+hw7BS0ZXz5SDjxf2bgqBFUjhIvzr6JFSF5SOxIN0\n8XsJnhUXFtt1CJCb5hh7D2V71jMPx8ZWGJm+YPbwDfm3JfLJbzV8wfEecUMjC2fX\nuR1BuWGQ/ja0m/PLIMv821DHblzpS2QTYvBkwZnSC4Xnp/ZU103EhetXMpnDDlGh\nTFZ6b+Ub2kKw2MlJqtJf8TFRlHUY3Altq1owQAC8t43