commits/8d7e6a2b262c2009158be9b5f863f5a551cac691"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1631630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheshirecode","id":1631630,"login":"cheshirecode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzE2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheshirecode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/commits/2f625a8e80ff39bfac9d83a9f0167b8f5eccc470/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:21:57Z","email":"1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheshireCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:21:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: pre-bundle the app-react Netlify function so SSR works (#42)\n\nThe deployed function 502''d with \"Cannot find package ''@cheshirecode/hono-base''\":\nNetlify''s function bundler doesn''t follow pnpm workspace symlinks, so the workspace\ndeps were left as bare runtime imports. Pre-bundle the function with esbuild in\nbuild-site.mjs into a single self-contained netlify/functions/app-react.mjs (workspace\ndeps, React, emotion all inlined; a createRequire banner lets react-dom/server''s\nrequire(''util'') work in ESM). Move the source to netlify/functions-src/.\n\nAlso add excludedPath: ''/apps/react/client/*'' so the function no longer intercepts the\nstatic client assets (they 502''d too).\n\nAdds scripts/smoke-site.mjs to smoke-test a deployed URL (all routes 200 + app-react SSR).\n\nVerified locally: the bundled function imports with no MODULE_NOT_FOUND, returns 200,\nand server-renders with subpath-prefixed hydration assets.\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b365f6d9fecceacb69a25b97ac8441aef71e717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/4b365f6d9fecceacb69a25b97ac8441aef71e717"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/2f625a8e80ff39bfac9d83a9f0167b8f5eccc470","verification":{"payload":"tree 4b365f6d9fecceacb69a25b97ac8441aef71e717\nparent e3c7409766ea3729770b5b5a30e8bb2cef17cfea\nauthor cheshireCode <1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com> 1784578917 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784578917 -0700\n\nfix: pre-bundle the app-react Netlify function so SSR works (#42)\n\nThe deployed function 502''d with \"Cannot find package ''@cheshirecode/hono-base''\":\nNetlify''s function bundler doesn''t follow pnpm workspace symlinks, so the workspace\ndeps were left as bare runtime imports. Pre-bundle the function with esbuild in\nbuild-site.mjs into a single self-contained netlify/functions/app-react.mjs (workspace\ndeps, React, emotion all inlined; a createRequire banner lets react-dom/server''s\nrequire(''util'') work in ESM). Move the source to netlify/functions-src/.\n\nAlso add excludedPath: ''/apps/react/client/*'' so the function no longer intercepts the\nstatic client assets (they 502''d too).\n\nAdds scripts/smoke-site.mjs to smoke-test a deployed URL (all routes 200 + app-react SSR).\n\nVerified locally: the bundled function imports with no MODULE_NOT_FOUND, returns 200,\nand server-renders with subpath-prefixed hydration assets.\n\nCo-