ages, add main field tarball validation (#30)\n\nmeasure-hook and eslint-config-react are CJS packages (main + no\nexports, no type:module). PR #28 set sideEffects:false on both, but\nbundlers cannot reliably tree-shake CommonJS modules — module.exports\nis dynamic. Changed to sideEffects:true, the semantically correct\nvalue for non-ESM packages.\n\ncheck-publishable.mjs now validates the main field against tarball\ncontents for packages that use main without exports (measure-hook,\neslint-config-react). Previously, a broken main path would ship with\npublish-check green — the same class of gap that #26 fixed for exports\nand #27 fixed for bin.\n\nWorklog-Slug: monorepo-metadata-quality\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd6eaa908543f9cec0b9ffb7245eeb1ce950af31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/trees/cd6eaa908543f9cec0b9ffb7245eeb1ce950af31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheshirecode/moon-pnpm-monorepo-boilerplate/git/commits/8f577e9b161b1e164ab75b137e27264812d7260c","verification":{"payload":"tree cd6eaa908543f9cec0b9ffb7245eeb1ce950af31\nparent 83e040d2ae14186f1ff2ccee4981b70306beeefd\nauthor cheshireCode <1631630+cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com> 1783615048 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783615048 -0700\n\nAudit fix: correct sideEffects for CJS packages, add main field tarball validation (#30)\n\nmeasure-hook and eslint-config-react are CJS packages (main + no\nexports, no type:module). PR #28 set sideEffects:false on both, but\nbundlers cannot reliably tree-shake CommonJS modules — module.exports\nis dynamic. Changed to sideEffects:true, the semantically correct\nvalue for non-ESM packages.\n\ncheck-publishable.mjs now validates the main field against tarball\ncontents for packages that use main without exports (measure-hook,\neslint-config-react). Previously, a broken main path would ship with\npublish-check green — the same class of gap that #26 fixed for exports\nand #27 fixed for bin.\n\nWorklog-Slug: monorepo-metadata-quality\n\nCo-authored-by: cheshirecode <cheshirecode@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT85ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQLgQAFT+NugAf/9dNWPFMDEFc/QU\nIs8lX5j9UW2gWR1Ek8Y1MaF0UnVDSiiqxfoh5kL+2UAHJ85VxK68iXeitRgtf4E7\nWdtIxBOLn+ngKnfi6Bj6Ke6rn8xZERI/+2yk7x0c6A3uzyHt8EkGrPxWFpQE3LSS\nB99pn1YOu1wo2xcg5saKtswzJzrUZbDWIr5Xhwbmd+jvYFnojqwpVHypXR+V59ET\nTlO9I5T2iREDaBIr8UAwe9HL7y5Xiv+zVDAmRyI3nHEVWjsNQUaDUjpOmhqYxArK\nXb/bgeDz8KeWzrzSnKwWR+OlSh6+qlvmctmXwQyiiZejFbnIf6Wz2cCty0UPCffI\nvUIpFoOF0nuTYuAvdAD3NmsDoMR5C7pC3mZK3DT0ZMz0yjBlk8YqOTvjnmXP6Lbh\nVHAnxkGQIACOFwrGjSZJmyTapBe1rwhvSdwDNc4WP5zJcjgsBze8xhO9uQIrUPjd\nB5r1vnLd0ZLfQ3+rTMfLs7bjfgSG37QiJrDOrYxdYDKKWYEOxHPQ3/B89PsY749k\nTDE7bQulSoj60TPSZntyYbAPM1pHI7cdBhVF+tgr5+xJ6EBCbveITxoNMVZn9PCP\nS1U4LlJRh3sEBvSpxxSrbHxyZua5vBPZVm49EFr/52bY7MsDenTlpjST2RAdINTz\ne/6zA//A4G37fBwCeyfN\n=ZQ+u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T16:37:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","us