com","name":"vfranco00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:20:05Z","email":"victorfranco02@outlook.com","name":"vfranco00"},"message":"Corrige permissão ao consolidar assets e atualiza checkout\n\nO passo de consolidação falhava com \"Permission denied\" ao copiar os SVGs\n3D para dist/. Causa: Platane/snk é uma action Docker, roda como root e\ncria dist/ com dono root, enquanto os passos \"run\" executam como o usuário\nrunner. Adiciona chown antes da cópia.\n\nSobe actions/checkout de v4 para v7, eliminando o aviso de deprecação do\nNode.js 20 nos runners.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VbkBpoMerNsSVb9k4Au2S","tree":{"sha":"42a7b7d1b9a3011c0490bc8c2113d831ff958e44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/git/trees/42a7b7d1b9a3011c0490bc8c2113d831ff958e44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/git/commits/db4e5191bef02a085a65c813a6c853156bcfb0ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93010166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vfranco00","id":93010166,"login":"vfranco00","node_id":"U_kgDOBYs49g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vfranco00/vfranco00/commit/db4e5191bef02a085a65c813a6c853156bcfb0ac","node_id":"C_kwDOH4GTVNoAKGRiNGU1MTkxYmVmMDJhMDg1YTY1YzgxM2E2Yzg1MzE1NmJjZmIwYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vfranco00/vfranco00/commit/399fd63dc2df8ec216631d73a70758e0866a0442","sha":"399fd63dc2df8ec216631d73a70758e0866a0442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/commits/399fd63dc2df8ec216631d73a70758e0866a0442"}],"sha":"db4e5191bef02a085a65c813a6c853156bcfb0ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/commits/db4e5191bef02a085a65c813a6c853156bcfb0ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93010166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vfranco00","id":93010166,"login":"vfranco00","node_id":"U_kgDOBYs49g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/commits/399fd63dc2df8ec216631d73a70758e0866a0442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:18:36Z","email":"victorfranco02@outlook.com","name":"vfranco00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:18:36Z","email":"victorfranco02@outlook.com","name":"vfranco00"},"message":"Reestrutura README e consolida pipeline de assets\n\nO README não possuía nenhum heading markdown: as seções eram linhas de\ntexto puro, o que renderizava tudo como um único parágrafo corrido no\nGitHub. Toda a hierarquia foi refeita com headings e listas reais.\n\nPipeline:\n- Remove main.ymlsnake.yml e snack.yml. Os três workflows tinham o mesmo\n  nome, o mesmo cron e faziam push para a mesma branch output, um\n  sobrescrevendo os artefatos do outro. Por isso os SVGs de tema claro e\n  escuro respondiam 404 enquanto os jobs marcavam sucesso.\n- Unifica snake e contribuições 3D em um job com um único push, mais\n  concurrency group, para que a corrida não volte.\n- Atualiza as actions: checkout v4, snk v3.5.0, 3d-contrib v0.9.3,\n  github-pages v5.\n\nREADME:\n- Adiciona seção terminal, snake e grade 3D (ambos com prefers-color-scheme).\n- Remove os cards de stats, top-langs, troféus e activity graph: as\n  instâncias públicas respondem DEPLOYMENT_PAUSED / DEPLOYMENT_DISABLED.\n- Substitui os pin cards mortos por tabela de projetos com badges\n  dinâmicos do shields.io.\n- Migra o typing SVG de herokuapp.com para demolab.com.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VbkBpoMerNsSVb9k4Au2S","tree":{"sha":"86319e00e334ecf2f771b153c78fc9f013b6c758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/git/trees/86319e00e334ecf2f771b153c78fc9f013b6c758"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vfranco00/vfranco00/git/commits/399fd63dc2df8ec216631d73a70758e0866a0442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93010166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vfranco00/gi