://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/460d724631b0397601d5b869e214ac6ac1c15ff1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:30:57Z","email":"fatih@opsmill.com","name":"Fatih Acar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:16:35Z","email":"fatih-acar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fatih-acar"},"message":"fix: move the flow run reservation from the enterprise worker to the community worker [INFP-689]\n\nThis moves to the community worker the work done in\nhttps://github.com/opsmill/infrahub-private/commit/fdc09f2edf9eb88d1ac00b35deda7508200c28bf\n(\"sync flow run submission across workers\"), which this pull request\nsupersedes, in the form opsmill/infrahub-private#479 reworked it into.\n\nEvery task worker now reserves a run in the cache for 15 seconds under\nits WORKER_IDENTITY before claiming it, so concurrent workers claim\ndifferent runs. Community workers used to claim the same runs and leave\nthe server to reject every losing claim.\n\n- CacheFlowRunReservations moves to infrahub/workers/reservations.py,\n  with its tests: a worker may reserve again a run it holds, which\n  restarts the 15 seconds, and it only releases its own reservations.\n- The reservation key stays flow-run-pending-<flow run id>, the key\n  fdc09f2 introduced, so earlier enterprise workers and new workers\n  respect each other''s reservations during an upgrade.\n- The reservations that always succeeded, and the hook the enterprise\n  worker overrode to replace them, are removed.\n\nWithout a reservation the Prefect server refuses a second claim only while the\nrun has not finished: a run that failed or crashed, or completed without a\npersisted result, accepts it and runs again. The task worker page now says so.\nOn a medium stack (4 workers), without the reservation each run was claimed\n3.6 times and Prefect API requests per run rose 32%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98a184440f57932f4b9c272aa49b20f415714c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/trees/98a184440f57932f4b9c272aa49b20f415714c17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/commits/460d724631b0397601d5b869e214ac6ac1c15ff1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fatih-acar","id":15028881,"login":"fatih-acar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opsmill/infrahub/commit/460d724631b0397601d5b869e214ac6ac1c15ff1","node_id":"C_kwDOH4TYMtoAKDQ2MGQ3MjQ2MzFiMDM5NzYwMWQ1Yjg2OWUyMTRhYzZhYzFjMTVmZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opsmill/infrahub/commit/74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca","sha":"74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca"}],"sha":"460d724631b0397601d5b869e214ac6ac1c15ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/460d724631b0397601d5b869e214ac6ac1c15ff1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fatih-acar","id":15028881,"login":"fatih-acar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:28:09Z","email":"fatih@opsmill.com","name":"Fatih Acar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:16:35Z","email":"fatih-acar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fatih-acar"},"message":"docs: document how task workers claim and start flow runs [INFP-689]\n\nAdds dev/knowledge/backend/task-workers.md: how a worker polls, the eight-call\nclaim sequence, the bounded submission window, reservations between workers\nand two known gaps. Links it from the priority lanes section, the dev index\nand the backend agent map.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8664084b45456c3f018f8ff834fb734dac458a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/trees/8664084b45456c3f018f8ff834fb734dac458a5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/commits/74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fatih-acar","id":15028881,"login":"fatih-acar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opsmill/infrahub/commit/74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca","node_id":"C_kwDOH4TYMtoAKDc0NzM0NDgzYmRlOTYzODM5NzY5YWM2NjM4NjExNzBlZDFkYjExY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opsmill/infrahub/commit/f600ed2ec6d24022e2ad18100bc83f7722116c8c","sha":"f600ed2ec6d24022e2ad18100bc83f7722116c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/f600ed2ec6d24022e2ad18100bc83f7722116c8c"}],"sha":"74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/74734483bde963839769ac663861170ed1db11ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fatih-acar","id":15028881,"login":"fatih-acar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/f600ed2ec6d24022e2ad18100bc83f7722116c8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:28:09Z","email":"fatih@opsmill.com","name":"Fatih Acar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:16:35Z","email":"fatih-acar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fatih-acar"},"message":"fix: claim scheduled flow runs through a bounded window in priority order [INFP-689]\n\nA task worker claimed every due run of every poll (up to 200) and pushed eight\nsequential Prefect API calls per claimed run through its single 16-connection\nclient. Each later poll, and each later high-priority run, queued behind the\nclaims of the whole backlog: under a generator-driven backlog of computed\nattribute runs a branch creation waited about forty times longer than its own\nexecution, and queue precedence only ordered runs inside one poll response.\n\nThe worker now claims at most eight runs at a time from the head of its latest\npoll, which the server orders by queue precedence, and takes the next candidate\nas soon as a claimed flow has started instead of waiting for the next poll.\nRuns left out stay scheduled on the server and are reordered by the next poll;\nrunning flows stay unbounded. A new poll leaves out the runs the worker took\nsince the previous one, which a poll read before those claims landed still\nlists as scheduled. A submission that fails is logged and gives back the slots\nof its batch, and the worker keeps polling.\n\nThe window reserves each run through a FlowRunReservations built by the\nworker: the community worker builds one that always succeeds and leaves\nduplicate claims to the server, and a subclass can plug in a shared\nreservation.\n\nMeasured with the AIDC generator chain on three fabrics and a branch creation\nthrough the UI mutation every 20 s, on 1.11.4 images with the changed files:\n- Enterprise small, with its cache reservation: branch creation p50/p95\n  60/110 s -> 6.3/7.5 s, backlog drain 25.6 -> 24.8 min; merge of the\n  generated branch 40/109 s -> 6.5/8.9 s\n- Community small, with an upstream Prefect actions-service fix: 82/165 s ->\n  5.7/8.0 s, drain 36.4 -> 28.6 min\n- Medium, 4 workers: windows of 12 and 16 drain no faster than 8, and 16\n  doubles the time of each claim\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bde61d0b95aca6ee4f4f577240d1b0c271dca115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/trees/bde61d0b95aca6ee4f4f577240d1b0c271dca115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/commits/f600ed2ec6d24022e2ad18100bc83f7722116c8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fatih-acar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/f