/users/BeArchiTek/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BeArchiTek","id":1334310,"login":"BeArchiTek","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzQzMTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeArchiTek/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeArchiTek/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeArchiTek/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeArchiTek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeArchiTek/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeArchiTek","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/d1e751ef52c66fd0334b514eea6472e5e83c1407/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:39:24Z","email":"BeArchiTek@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Benoit Kohler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:39:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): skip bug reviewer instead of failing, re-review fix changes (#10764)\n\nThe approval gate ran inside the agent job and used `exit 1` to skip,\nwhich turned every push after FIX_APPROVED/TEST_APPROVED into a failed\nrun. The gate now runs as a dedicated `review-gate` job (read-only\ncontents/issues/pull-requests) wired through `on.needs`, and gates the\nworkflow on its `should_review` output so skips show as skipped.\n\nAfter FIX_APPROVED, pushes that change non-test files trigger a new\nreview. The reviewer records the reviewed head as `AGENT_REVIEW_SHA`,\nand the gate diffs it against the new head. Threshold and ignored paths\nare tunable via the BUG_REVIEW_REREVIEW_MIN_LINES and\nBUG_REVIEW_REREVIEW_IGNORE_REGEX repository variables.\n\nCo-authored-by: Benoit Kohler <Kohler.benoit@bearchitek.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"363476cdb923d7c42e01eeb22db69395d74c16cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/trees/363476cdb923d7c42e01eeb22db69395d74c16cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/commits/d1e751ef52c66fd0334b514eea6472e5e83c1407","verification":{"payload":"tree 363476cdb923d7c42e01eeb22db69395d74c16cc\nparent 8ed876de7cfffc778563c48481d33d17730e2454\nauthor Benoit Kohler <BeArchiTek@users.noreply.github.com> 1790944764 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790944764 +0200\n\nfix(ci): skip bug reviewer instead of failing, re-review fix changes (#10764)\n\nThe approval gate ran inside the agent job and used `exit 1` to skip,\nwhich turned every push after FIX_APPROVED/TEST_APPROVED into a failed\nrun. The gate now runs as a dedicated `review-gate` job (read-only\ncontents/issues/pull-requests) wired through `on.needs`, and gates the\nworkflow on its `should_review` output so skips show as skipped.\n\nAfter FIX_APPROVED, pushes that change non-test files trigger a new\nreview. The reviewer records the reviewed head as `AGENT_REVIEW_SHA`,\nand the gate diffs it against the new head. Threshold and ignored paths\nare tunable via the BUG_REVIEW_REREVIEW_MIN_LINES and\nBUG_REVIEW_REREVIEW_IGNORE_REGEX repository variables.\n\nCo-authored-by: Benoit Kohler <Kohler.benoit@bearchitek.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv6X8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT/EQAHdPXZNy2aQEOgt6JhBMTvWE\npizOVZQQBOk14EftiK6lyVJ2LF5ZnzL2/TNlT5uh6ipVl+1yHrfvaOXgQ2vaoJhA\nKBapoqddPXXQkd0p69W6pJeew4W5twZOij6OdTpWA+vk/YY+WNWxqDv8ncp6zYEZ\nsxAGIB53arGMVVJrH+FTLPhYK6IVXb0O54JMQkhtClFg3UGrC1joz9W4v5CxPRdb\nePcKVgzz76kBwz4nfXyVOj1RVAHPOb2ZFSrz5CEmwBhL7CIJI3E34JNlhsNciTsH\n18Zu3jAjoW64/eWfu9kMYTAnafswlLQq3B3WGv4l8rDJWMkbmsVoOJrgl1bqTyQQ\nRvaR3AkHDZkKTAV//lWvUWDO8sE2KeZkWdFCcVMwXwhu7ytlxecPHPqF0Ty1aFen\ne+S4J5jSDWaMU+eJvytUM8PRqWS5HWXA0pAyP/Go+2OMLohbOfL5y28DyKbmbKz8\nLJa6H3uEwGunPbQsAaqvtuJqjnsBuejazQk14H+pHuTaP4PomaCDVSAjsxoGiXzO\nnDPoWlziuZGbOODAeIvmF4mKTRB4kY7VQpo/m77th0stpGOsvp1jknl2GK45SmLd\nF0Y0