repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/trees/ef34d4eed691125a45fc952171b808840fdfaf8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/commits/8ed876de7cfffc778563c48481d33d17730e2454","verification":{"payload":"tree ef34d4eed691125a45fc952171b808840fdfaf8c\nparent 5dfac29ed9efcfb83b893e27cdeaab792eb978d5\nauthor Benoit Kohler <BeArchiTek@users.noreply.github.com> 1790941478 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790941478 +0200\n\ndocs: document Prometheus metrics and task manager monitoring (#10794)\n\n* docs: add metrics page and Prometheus metrics reference\n\nDocument where Infrahub exposes Prometheus metrics (API server, task\nworkers, Prefect exporter), how to monitor the task manager backlog, and\nlist every infrahub_* metric in a new reference page. Correct the FAQ\nmonitoring answer and document observability for Community Compose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: use the exposed name of the transaction retries counter\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: describe late runs and the flow-run lookback window precisely\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Benoit Kohler <Kohler.benoit@bearchitek.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv5kmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAe+kQAC1jgzQVjcCbgc7AuBe2gMtr\n8/SOZty3M/1I3tnwGktvbITycKggRRrMBfFeOtcW0Trxi/3fbQ97lplUPcBfTNwI\n+TSzw0qRvZ7OSUbBYxyJifhNyfNMcWvYOr1QGaCuix2HHILmUDu8gqdjIAJV5h5U\nAR8Lg8EFoB8Q+kLJC24iauAjy0NXiK6RCW9O9zarEkSBNoQv70fbQJHGb+Dh7VP/\nNKp4hirBM6quhjhfwEO58W3/uRuPrB4BoDEVQngZTzCgAyd6tSCezX9XzWhSbSpn\nnGRSSQMMKPuI88mk5wXMdzEgARGeynEJVoc7Md7kWDtEy9wOyIS7xJMUJiStv0Pl\n9X23fn5p9PIzpJqRwEnL//5OpTAnz8o/7Swle8NOqf8JOtxeCKwlE+3gPwWSqfUc\nVAv8L+94uQv8fYa1EtyB3+biQtuEHuKQ7ntIPtswuHuBJahBTz1j3vSDphqXqq5t\nulqIDjEwZXCuCD3GLUk9MKnVVPQfCeDbhY1RjrzJKnqTjHPYOjCRgvKhpLgsR+jd\nKzhdiICfVpPMGWQSTw/1pqldrpWAcROV