ithub.com/users/polmichel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/polmichel","id":40861490,"login":"polmichel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwODYxNDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/polmichel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/commits/304579e2608973f17ac4246aed637eee6a6f4386/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:09:45Z","email":"40861490+polmichel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pol Michel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:09:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(diff): list only branch-aware changes when chunking the diff calculation (#10760)\n\nThe field- and property-level changed-nodes queries collected every node\nwith an edge changed on the branch, including branch-local fields, which\nthe paths queries they scope never return paths for. Those nodes only\ndiluted the chunks and added runs of the paths queries that matched\nnothing. Both queries now apply the same branch-support filter as the\npaths queries.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53275e7cd33548f1804c636d433ed8891bd696e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/trees/53275e7cd33548f1804c636d433ed8891bd696e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opsmill/infrahub/git/commits/304579e2608973f17ac4246aed637eee6a6f4386","verification":{"payload":"tree 53275e7cd33548f1804c636d433ed8891bd696e2\nparent ddd85cacf2df18c87d8c6cf874ce7e4d897b7ecc\nauthor Pol Michel <40861490+polmichel@users.noreply.github.com> 1790705385 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790705385 +0200\n\nfix(diff): list only branch-aware changes when chunking the diff calculation (#10760)\n\nThe field- and property-level changed-nodes queries collected every node\nwith an edge changed on the branch, including branch-local fields, which\nthe paths queries they scope never return paths for. Those nodes only\ndiluted the chunks and added runs of the paths queries that matched\nnothing. Both queries now apply the same branch-support filter as the\npaths queries.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu/7pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXHcQAG77nhc8vfOLJdBaCsdgWctM\np2d8NDrD/U0M9KRbXrvNvvFSggXLj7b5m7SdHyuKjK3kyNu0kVgWyaQc7sGq2GSn\nzdGCUSEbq4E/ITpfcb1kS9C8HExk/twjwc8yfqNmnzsmesazn52dck1H+rqR5rMn\nkt+vQX8ZO0UIVwRQ+Q977ffqPFVWM+m76oO9VIW6awJniObmuJOkmuB76p0NypDD\nJM0bfxg2MkD7b66J/grZRFrLLqObhFck1ehH1anVu1kYbvtPD+5WK4UjvjCv2RML\n9t2qdtKm++f5CZ4/em0HASX8FJa2Duf+Hb6a8kB1BpHJ2m2VarRaYU74d5NTgbZ6\nzAYtsOSn3LV5GHA/Z2d8SWsRm2/yGXv6VUZ9rPsu972DJSQgeOVLbKMnB6IBsJJP\nG4X99ZA2YvNcOwDqcub0pRyl8jCtbD6ogSqgfcsDO8Cm8niDP1mG8X/qPrdlmrjx\nKzKQQLItCzldze2dFE6unY0kQH40SAEmn+Xcm7oWt3ysko7/TQU4K6sfxNNycr5e\nP/8AdeMf5t4egxN15T7pe6+V1PHhhEBYHVmX5zTIYR5vFehd8F/IUUoZRv1kCulK\nV0+w1IRp9yXJT/+lWIf3R/K/I6DKeINkI3Oq6eIKLtirdWuLaKPGmS6RSA3CDHNK\ntaWuoEJl9F0t/zEv/CYx\n=wqyB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T18:09:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gist